00:17:42,120 --> 00:17:43,800
A thousand faces blend in the crowd,

572
00:17:43,800 --> 00:17:44,440
one true...

573
00:17:44,760 --> 00:17:45,880
Wait, let him say the second half.

574
00:17:47,640 --> 00:17:48,880
One true purpose to help mankind.

575
00:17:49,420 --> 00:17:51,160
(Identity confirmed)
Man, we're on the same side.

576
00:17:51,160 --> 00:17:52,200
We're in the same organization.

577
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:52,880
You don't remember me?

578
00:17:53,560 --> 00:17:54,160
Who are you?

579
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:55,040
You two saved the villagers together.

580
00:17:55,040 --> 00:17:55,320
Don't you remember?

581
00:17:55,320 --> 00:17:56,320
You came to rescue me, right?

582
00:17:56,320 --> 00:17:57,040
Yes.

583
00:17:57,040 --> 00:17:58,240
Help me then.

584
00:17:58,240 --> 00:17:59,140
(Come save me)

585
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:01,440
The key. Where's the key?

586
00:18:01,800 --> 00:18:03,640
What key?
We can open it with our bare hands.

587
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:04,560
We know martial arts.

588
00:18:04,560 --> 00:18:06,760
We can just break the chain.

589
00:18:06,760 --> 00:18:08,600
(Local accent, off the cuff)
Couldn't you do it yourself?

590
00:18:08,600 --> 00:18:10,200
It's already this loose.

591
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:11,560
Man, you...

592
00:18:11,560 --> 00:18:12,800
Look at this.

593
00:18:12,800 --> 00:18:13,680
Careful.

594
00:18:15,760 --> 00:18:16,200
Helpful Contact.

595
00:18:16,200 --> 00:18:17,640
Okay, Helpful Contact.

596
00:18:17,640 --> 00:18:18,440
Let's sit on the bed first.

597
00:18:19,360 --> 00:18:20,760
So what exactly happened?

598
00:18:20,760 --> 00:18:21,520
Helpful Contact.

599
00:18:21,520 --> 00:18:22,040
Yeah, Helpful Contact.

600
00:18:22,800 --> 00:18:25,040
I went undercover at R Corporation.

601
00:18:25,040 --> 00:18:25,920
But I didn't expect...

602
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:28,360
their boss found me.

603
00:18:28,880 --> 00:18:29,640
Then...

604
00:18:30,600 --> 00:18:31,600
they brought me here

605
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:33,440
and tortured me for four hours.

606
00:18:34,140 --> 00:18:35,240
(Helpful Contact was discovered
while undercover at R Corporation)

607
00:18:35,240 --> 00:18:37,440
Before that, I texted a few members

608
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:38,560
of the Thousand-Faced Eagle King.

609
00:18:39,800 --> 00:18:41,240
I hoped they could find a way

610
00:18:41,240 --> 00:18:42,520
to take the living treasures away

611
00:18:42,520 --> 00:18:43,360
from the auction

612
00:18:43,360 --> 00:18:44,600
and keep them safe.

613
00:18:44,800 --> 00:18:45,920
(Helpful Contact posted a mission)
But because of that,

614
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:46,880
(to take the living treasure
from the auction)

615
00:18:46,880 --> 00:18:48,320
R Corporation used my identity

616
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:50,360
to send false information

617
00:18:51,320 --> 00:18:52,440
to one of you

618
00:18:52,960 --> 00:18:54,160
and trick you into coming here.

619
00:18:54,220 --> 00:18:55,180
(R Corporation sent Jin a fake location)

620
00:18:55,180 --> 00:18:55,960
(to lure the three treasures in)

621
00:18:55,960 --> 00:18:56,400
Right.

622
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:57,520
Curator Tui...

623
00:18:58,680 --> 00:18:59,680
He should have

624
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:00,400
Thousand-Faced Eagle King's

625
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:02,120
kite spool.

626
00:19:03,240 --> 00:19:04,800
But after what happened to him today,

627
00:19:06,360 --> 00:19:07,520
R Corporation moved everything

628
00:19:07,520 --> 00:19:08,320
over here.

629
00:19:09,920 --> 00:19:10,520
Let's search again.

630
00:19:15,740 --> 00:19:17,220
(Curator Tui's office)

631
00:19:25,200 --> 00:19:25,680
A kite.

632
00:19:26,240 --> 00:19:27,240
The kite string used

633
00:19:27,240 --> 00:19:28,120
to send messages.

634
00:19:28,120 --> 00:19:28,900
(Tui Exhibition Hall Investigation)

635
00:19:29,680 --> 00:19:30,600
What is this used for?

636
00:19:31,520 --> 00:19:32,480
It records

637
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:34,440
the true history
of Thousand-Faced Eagle King.

638
00:19:35,280 --> 00:19:36,160
I hope that you all

639
00:19:36,920 --> 00:19:38,400
can clear Thousand-Faced Eagle King's name.

640
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:39,880
I know why we need to clear his name.

641
00:19:39,880 --> 00:19:41,520
Because the Tui family

642
00:19:41,520 --> 00:19:42,880
claimed the story
of Thousand-Faced Eagle King

643
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:44,160
belonged to them.

644
00:19:44,160 --> 00:19:45,840
It's the same thing you want to do.

645
00:19:45,840 --> 00:19:46,160
Yeah, right.

646
00:19:46,160 --> 00:19:46,480
Right?

647
00:19:46,480 --> 00:19:50,480
To stop others from pretending
to be Thousand-Faced Eagle King.

648
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:51,200
Okay, got it.

649
00:19:51,200 --> 00:19:52,360
There's a piece of paper inside.

650
00:19:52,800 --> 00:19:55,960
Tui Exhibition Hall Investigation

651
00:19:55,960 --> 00:19:57,000
Someone came here

652
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:59,360
and checked in at Tui Exhibition Hall,

653
00:19:59,360 --> 00:20:01,080
taking pictures of the displays.

654
00:20:01,080 --> 00:20:02,120
I think this must connect

655
00:20:02,120 --> 00:20:03,160
with what we're going

656
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:04,400
to find downstairs.

657
00:20:04,400 --> 00:20:05,200
To see if it's the same.

658
00:20:05,200 --> 00:20:05,800
Right.

659
00:20:06,440 --> 00:20:07,640
Look, he's measuring the arm length.

660
00:20:07,640 --> 00:20:08,600
I think we need

661
00:20:08,600 --> 00:20:10,040
to remeasure the window's

662
00:20:10,040 --> 00:20:10,840
position later.

663
00:20:10,840 --> 00:20:12,280
Use this picture to locate it.

664
00:20:12,280 --> 00:20:12,920
Definitely.

665
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:13,640
Well, well, you.

666
00:20:13,640 --> 00:20:13,960
Smart.

667
00:20:14,440 --> 00:20:15,440
Your brain works pretty well.

668
00:20:15,440 --> 00:20:16,120
I'm a complete person.

669
00:20:17,720 --> 00:20:19,040
The founder
of Thousand-Faced Eagle King.

670
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:19,880
Read what's written on it.

671
00:20:20,280 --> 00:20:21,320
These are all names.

672
00:20:21,480 --> 00:20:23,080
Yang Glory.

673
00:20:23,080 --> 00:20:24,240
Yan Reason.

674
00:20:24,240 --> 00:20:25,440
Jin Thrifty.

675
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:27,600
These are the names
of the villagers from back then.

676
00:20:27,600 --> 00:20:29,720
They're the real Thousand-Faced Eagle King.

677
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:30,240
And...

678
00:20:30,240 --> 00:20:31,520
There's also a key.

679
00:20:31,520 --> 00:20:32,840
Right, a small key.

680
00:20:35,440 --> 00:20:36,720
There's a lock
in private exhibition room.

681
00:20:40,680 --> 00:20:42,520
This key might be the one

682
00:20:42,520 --> 00:20:43,600
the curator left here.

683
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:46,680
Right. Should we go check it out?

684
00:20:46,840 --> 00:20:48,160
Alright, everyone. Here's the situation.

685
00:20:48,520 --> 00:20:50,360
I also have some criminal evidence

686
00:20:50,360 --> 00:20:51,720
against R Corporation.

687
00:20:52,760 --> 00:20:53,680
You should've said that earlier.

688
00:20:53,680 --> 00:20:54,800
Once we leave here,

689
00:20:55,280 --> 00:20:56,880
