690
00:20:57,080 --> 00:20:59,160
But there's one serious problem.

691
00:20:59,160 --> 00:20:59,840
We can't leave yet.

692
00:21:00,280 --> 00:21:00,720
What is it?

693
00:21:00,720 --> 00:21:01,320
What?

694
00:21:01,320 --> 00:21:03,400
R Corporation
kidnapped innocent villagers

695
00:21:04,440 --> 00:21:05,360
for biological experiments.

696
00:21:06,320 --> 00:21:07,760
Before you leave,

697
00:21:08,200 --> 00:21:09,200
you have to rescue them.

698
00:21:10,400 --> 00:21:11,600
The rescue mission.

699
00:21:11,600 --> 00:21:13,240
(Side Quest) We're descendants
of the Thousand-Faced Eagle King.

700
00:21:13,240 --> 00:21:13,880
(Side Quest Activated)
Right.

701
00:21:13,880 --> 00:21:14,640
(Rescue the captive villagers)
Our ancestors

702
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:15,520
were true heroes.

703
00:21:15,520 --> 00:21:16,360
Of course.

704
00:21:16,360 --> 00:21:17,680
(Carry on their legacy)
No, I am.

705
00:21:17,680 --> 00:21:19,760
The Thousand-Faced Eagle King
was founded

706
00:21:19,760 --> 00:21:20,200
because of

707
00:21:20,200 --> 00:21:21,000
the Longdong Army.

708
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:21,520
That's right.

709
00:21:21,520 --> 00:21:22,800
That's my dream.

710
00:21:22,800 --> 00:21:23,910
Peace across the land.

711
00:21:23,910 --> 00:21:25,680
May all live in harmony.

712
00:21:25,680 --> 00:21:26,280
Wait.

713
00:21:26,280 --> 00:21:28,280
A poem just came to mind.

714
00:21:28,280 --> 00:21:30,320
The army unleashed!

715
00:21:30,320 --> 00:21:33,030
Defend our homeland!

716
00:21:33,040 --> 00:21:35,880
(The Longdong spirit lives on!)
Longdong still stands!

717
00:21:36,020 --> 00:21:37,520
(Getting fired up again)

718
00:21:37,520 --> 00:21:38,280
All I know is...

719
00:21:38,280 --> 00:21:38,640
Go ahead.

720
00:21:38,640 --> 00:21:40,400
The villagers are on the second floor.

721
00:21:41,040 --> 00:21:42,120
Okay, got it.

722
00:21:42,120 --> 00:21:43,360
We'll rescue them.

723
00:21:43,360 --> 00:21:43,960
Leave it to us.

724
00:21:45,160 --> 00:21:46,480
(Leave it to Thousand-Faced Eagle King)
I will be the hero.

725
00:21:46,480 --> 00:21:47,480
According to my investigation,

726
00:21:48,280 --> 00:21:50,160
the access card to the room
holding the villagers

727
00:21:50,160 --> 00:21:51,280
is placed

728
00:21:51,920 --> 00:21:53,040
