729
00:21:53,040 --> 00:21:54,560
that requires a voice command to open.

730
00:21:54,840 --> 00:21:55,720
Okay.

731
00:21:56,000 --> 00:21:57,000
(The voice command box below)
You can find the voice command here.

732
00:21:57,000 --> 00:21:57,720
(stores the access card
to the detention room)

733
00:21:57,720 --> 00:21:58,440
Okay.

734
00:21:58,460 --> 00:22:00,200
(Screen for voice command)

735
00:22:00,200 --> 00:22:02,040
But as far as I know,

736
00:22:02,040 --> 00:22:04,080
the command only works for two minutes.

737
00:22:04,080 --> 00:22:04,480
Okay.

738
00:22:04,480 --> 00:22:05,640
So it's not enough time

739
00:22:05,640 --> 00:22:07,280
to read the command here

740
00:22:07,280 --> 00:22:07,920
then going to open the safe.

741
00:22:07,920 --> 00:22:09,640
Best is you all are split
into two groups.

742
00:22:10,360 --> 00:22:11,360
Three each.

743
00:22:12,080 --> 00:22:13,880
One group stays here
to read the command.

744
00:22:13,880 --> 00:22:15,920
The other group standbys at the safe.

745
00:22:15,980 --> 00:22:18,900
(They need to work in groups
to use the command)

746
00:22:18,920 --> 00:22:20,120
One more important thing.

747
00:22:20,640 --> 00:22:22,960
The group who reads the commands

748
00:22:22,960 --> 00:22:24,960
must find me after you succeed.

749
00:22:24,960 --> 00:22:26,000
I will bring them

750
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:27,680
to my pre-arranged car

751
00:22:27,680 --> 00:22:28,680
to help the ones downstairs.

752
00:22:29,120 --> 00:22:30,680
(Three of them go with the helpful contact)
The other three saving the villagers

753
00:22:31,040 --> 00:22:32,560
(The other three will save the villagers)
must not make any noise

754
00:22:32,560 --> 00:22:33,600
under any circumstances.

755
00:22:33,600 --> 00:22:34,080
Got it.

756
00:22:34,080 --> 00:22:36,640
Or you will alert R Corporation's
patrolling security.

757
00:22:36,640 --> 00:22:37,360
That's right.

758
00:22:37,380 --> 00:22:38,480
(Bad feeling about this)

759
00:22:38,480 --> 00:22:39,200
A reminder.

760
00:22:39,200 --> 00:22:39,480
Okay.

761
00:22:39,480 --> 00:22:41,040
The three going to save the villagers

762
00:22:41,040 --> 00:22:43,760
