763
00:22:45,200 --> 00:22:46,480
We're doomed. We're disabled.

764
00:22:46,960 --> 00:22:47,760
We're disabled.

765
00:22:47,760 --> 00:22:48,720
(We probably can't go)
We're half-disabled.

766
00:22:48,720 --> 00:22:49,440
We both.

767
00:22:49,440 --> 00:22:50,880
You're just a fence-sitter.

768
00:22:50,880 --> 00:22:51,360
He.

769
00:22:52,360 --> 00:22:53,560
I just realized.

770
00:22:54,880 --> 00:22:55,320
Okay.

771
00:22:55,320 --> 00:22:57,240
They'll stay here for the secret.

772
00:22:57,240 --> 00:22:58,440
How will the people below know?

773
00:22:59,160 --> 00:23:00,400
Through what?

774
00:23:00,700 --> 00:23:02,460
