to save the villagers?)

775
00:23:02,480 --> 00:23:03,880
Wait. Let's see.

776
00:23:03,880 --> 00:23:05,480
Could it be something like charades?

777
00:23:05,480 --> 00:23:07,080
They'll have to guess the answer.

778
00:23:08,800 --> 00:23:09,600
Outside the window.

779
00:23:10,680 --> 00:23:11,400
Does this open up?

780
00:23:11,800 --> 00:23:13,360
No way.

781
00:23:13,880 --> 00:23:14,640
I don't think so.

782
00:23:14,960 --> 00:23:16,560
It really is.

783
00:23:18,840 --> 00:23:19,600
Let's check this out first.

784
00:23:23,160 --> 00:23:23,880
Here.

785
00:23:24,920 --> 00:23:25,640
We can look here.

786
00:23:28,480 --> 00:23:29,160
This way.

787
00:23:30,200 --> 00:23:31,640
We'll act it out here.

788
00:23:32,080 --> 00:23:33,360
We can't make any noise.

789
00:23:33,360 --> 00:23:34,680
So the three of us will stay.

790
00:23:34,680 --> 00:23:35,960
You guys watch us from down there.

791
00:23:36,520 --> 00:23:37,040
Yeah.

792
00:23:37,520 --> 00:23:37,880
Okay.

793
00:23:38,680 --> 00:23:39,840
Alright. It's decided. Let's go.

794
00:23:39,840 --> 00:23:40,520
The three of us will go.

795
00:23:40,520 --> 00:23:41,200
We'll read the command.

796
00:23:41,640 --> 00:23:43,240
(Assignment: He, Ding, Ke mime the command)
Jin, is that alright?

797
00:23:43,240 --> 00:23:43,720
Sure.

798
00:23:43,720 --> 00:23:44,040
Yang.

799
00:23:44,040 --> 00:23:44,680
I'm scared I'll fail you, Ning.

800
00:23:44,680 --> 00:23:45,640
(Ning, Jin, Yang enter the command for the key)
It's such an important mission.

801
00:23:46,000 --> 00:23:46,440
It's alright.

802
00:23:46,720 --> 00:23:48,440
It's been four seasons.

803
00:23:48,440 --> 00:23:50,240
I have the least Golden Keys.

804
00:23:50,240 --> 00:23:51,400
I'm bad at reasoning.

805
00:23:51,400 --> 00:23:53,320
It's time I become useful.

806
00:23:53,800 --> 00:23:56,080
Or I'll be remove next season.

807
00:23:56,080 --> 00:23:57,640
I lost more than I gained.

808
00:23:57,640 --> 00:23:58,360
I'm leaving.

809
00:23:59,000 --> 00:23:59,480
Let's go, Yang.

810
00:24:01,520 --> 00:24:02,040
You can do it.

811
00:24:02,200 --> 00:24:03,960
I have nothing I'm good at.

812
00:24:03,960 --> 00:24:06,520
Right now, watch me, Iron Tank.

813
00:24:08,720 --> 00:24:10,000
Okay.

814
00:24:10,020 --> 00:24:10,580
(Side Quest:
Rescue the imprisoned villagers)

815
00:24:10,580 --> 00:24:11,180
(1. Obtain voice command
to open the safe)

816
00:24:11,180 --> 00:24:11,820
(2. Obtain the key to the room
holding the villagers)

817
00:24:11,820 --> 00:24:12,420
(3. Save the villagers)

818
00:24:12,440 --> 00:24:15,880
Heaven calls upon us.

819
00:24:18,460 --> 00:24:21,140
(A safe containing the keys
to the room holding the villagers)

820
00:24:21,580 --> 00:24:23,100
(Ning, Jin, and Yang arrived
at the designated place)

821
00:24:23,600 --> 00:24:25,600
This is where your chemistry
with He will be tested.

822
00:24:26,080 --> 00:24:27,160
It depends if he can

823
00:24:27,160 --> 00:24:27,480
do a good job.

824
00:24:27,540 --> 00:24:29,440
(Feeling the stress)

825
00:24:29,440 --> 00:24:30,600
You'll do it outside.

826
00:24:30,600 --> 00:24:31,160
You'll show it to Ning.

827
00:24:31,160 --> 00:24:31,520
Sure.

828
00:24:31,520 --> 00:24:31,880
Yes.

829
00:24:32,160 --> 00:24:33,240
He knows Ning better.

830
00:24:40,200 --> 00:24:40,920
He's here.

831
00:24:40,980 --> 00:24:42,700
(Mimer in position)

832
00:24:42,740 --> 00:24:44,740
(Guesser in position)

833
00:24:44,760 --> 00:24:46,920
Read this to obtain the command.

834
00:24:47,400 --> 00:24:49,120
R Corporation is the best.

835
00:24:49,480 --> 00:24:50,440
R Corporation is the best!

836
00:24:50,780 --> 00:24:52,260
(Voice command: Dripping with jewels)

837
00:24:52,380 --> 00:24:53,900
(Report)

838
00:24:53,900 --> 00:24:57,300
(Voice command: Dripping with jewels)

839
00:24:57,320 --> 00:24:58,080
Dripping with jewels.

840
00:25:01,120 --> 00:25:01,720
Four words.

841
00:25:04,160 --> 00:25:04,640
Pig.

842
00:25:05,620 --> 00:25:06,500
(Great)
Pig.

843
00:25:07,680 --> 00:25:08,360
Second word.

844
00:25:10,060 --> 00:25:11,860
(Strip naked)

845
00:25:12,420 --> 00:25:13,700
(Strip naked)

846
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:17,840
Strip?

847
00:25:18,760 --> 00:25:19,040
Strip.

848
00:25:19,040 --> 00:25:19,720
Pig strip.

849
00:25:20,220 --> 00:25:21,140
(Not related to stripping)

850
00:25:21,260 --> 00:25:22,020
(Empty)

851
00:25:23,280 --> 00:25:24,120
(Hair)
Pig, strip, head.

852
00:25:24,120 --> 00:25:24,920
