2747
01:22:38,960 --> 01:22:39,680
The development of technology

2748
01:22:39,680 --> 01:22:42,000
must never cross the boundaries of life.

2749
01:22:42,000 --> 01:22:43,680
As technology continues to advance,

2750
01:22:43,680 --> 01:22:44,800
we must always be mindful

2751
01:22:44,800 --> 01:22:47,080
of the red line of technological ethics.

2752
01:22:47,200 --> 01:22:48,200
In this case,

2753
