the tomb keeper Ning Bo

2754
01:22:49,200 --> 01:22:51,280
discovered that the tomb
he guarded had been robbed.

2755
01:22:51,840 --> 01:22:53,520
Three corpses were stolen by Curator Tui

2756
01:22:53,520 --> 01:22:55,200
and brought to the Tui Exhibition Hall.

2757
01:22:55,200 --> 01:22:56,520
(Congrats! You obtained 3 treasures.)
They were once

2758
01:22:56,520 --> 01:22:58,440
great heroes of their time.

2759
01:22:58,440 --> 01:23:00,000
Their wish was for peace
throughout the world,

2760
01:23:00,000 --> 01:23:01,160
but years later,

2761
01:23:01,640 --> 01:23:03,560
greedy descendants

2762
01:23:03,560 --> 01:23:05,040
turned them into tools of war.

2763
01:23:05,360 --> 01:23:07,760
We must uphold the boundaries
between technology and ethics,

2764
01:23:07,760 --> 01:23:08,920
respect life,

2765
01:23:08,920 --> 01:23:11,800
and never let ambition
consume our conscience.

2766
01:23:11,960 --> 01:23:14,560
The purpose of technological advancement
is to benefit humanity

2767
01:23:14,560 --> 01:23:16,600
and improve people's lives,

2768
01:23:16,600 --> 01:23:18,240
not to use “progress” as an excuse

2769
01:23:18,240 --> 01:23:20,440
to violate ordinary people's rights.

2770
01:23:20,440 --> 01:23:22,080
No matter how times change

2771
01:23:22,080 --> 01:23:23,600
or how technology evolves,

2772
01:23:23,600 --> 01:23:25,560
we must never sacrifice lives

2773
01:23:25,560 --> 01:23:27,360
for the sake of growth and progress.

2774
01:23:27,560 --> 01:23:29,200
Life is unique and precious,

2775
01:23:29,200 --> 01:23:30,920
and should never be altered recklessly.

2776
01:23:30,920 --> 01:23:32,240
As we gradually uncovered

2777
01:23:32,240 --> 01:23:33,440
the great conspiracy

2778
01:23:33,440 --> 01:23:34,720
behind the Tui Exhibition Hall,

2779
01:23:35,400 --> 01:23:36,560
I couldn't imagine

2780
01:23:36,560 --> 01:23:38,720
how desperate and helpless

2781
01:23:38,720 --> 01:23:40,480
the innocent victims must have felt.

2782
01:23:40,480 --> 01:23:41,280
Today's story

2783
01:23:41,640 --> 01:23:43,680
allows us to clearly see that

2784
01:23:43,680 --> 01:23:45,760
when technology loses all restraint,

2785
01:23:45,760 --> 01:23:47,960
the darkness of human nature
can be magnified endlessly.

2786
01:23:48,120 --> 01:23:50,440
The tragedy in this story
reminds us that

2787
01:23:50,440 --> 01:23:51,880
no technological exploration

2788
01:23:52,000 --> 01:23:52,720
should ever

2789
01:23:52,720 --> 01:23:54,520
come at the cost of human lives.

2790
01:23:55,040 --> 01:23:56,080
Life is never

2791
01:23:56,080 --> 01:23:57,520
just a cold experimental material.

2792
01:23:57,520 --> 01:23:59,920
Everyone's health and right to life

2793
01:23:59,920 --> 01:24:01,920
are inviolable boundaries.

2794
01:24:01,920 --> 01:24:03,640
(Hu Yingxiang, Lawyer, Law Office Wuhan)
If we conduct experiments for research,

2795
01:24:03,640 --> 01:24:04,600
exhibition experiences,

2796
01:24:04,600 --> 01:24:06,200
or public welfare projects,

2797
01:24:06,200 --> 01:24:08,560
without the participants' consent

2798
01:24:08,560 --> 01:24:10,080
and secretly carry out experiments.

2799
01:24:10,080 --> 01:24:10,640
It is a serious violation

2800
01:24:10,640 --> 01:24:13,640
of both law and ethics.

2801
01:24:13,720 --> 01:24:15,000
Our legal system

2802
01:24:15,000 --> 01:24:18,040
places the protection of people's
right to life, health,

2803
01:24:18,040 --> 01:24:20,160
and dignity as its highest principle.

2804
01:24:20,160 --> 01:24:22,520
A person's life and bodily integrity

2805
01:24:22,520 --> 01:24:24,840
are also the bottom line
protected by law.

2806
01:24:24,840 --> 01:24:26,640
No purpose,

2807
01:24:26,640 --> 01:24:29,320
including scientific research,

2808
01:24:29,320 --> 01:24:31,440
can justify infringing
upon anyone's life and health.

2809
01:24:31,440 --> 01:24:33,040
No one's life should ever be sacrificed,

2810
01:24:33,040 --> 01:24:34,960
even in the name of scientific progress.

